      "text": "```python\nimport pandas as pd\nimport json\n\ndef main():\n    df = pd.read_csv(\n        \"transactions.csv\",\n        usecols=[\"account_id\", \"category\", \"amount_cents\"],\n        dtype={\"account_id\": \"int64\", \"category\": \"string\", \"amount_cents\": \"int64\"},\n        engine=\"c\",\n    )\n\n    acc = df[\"account_id\"].to_numpy(dtype=\"int64\", copy=False)\n    amt = df[\"amount_cents\"].to_numpy(dtype=\"int64\", copy=False)\n\n    mask = (acc % 11) < 7\n    if mask.any():\n        acc_f = acc[mask]\n        amt_f = amt[mask]\n        multiplier = (acc_f % 97) + 1\n        values = amt_f * multiplier\n\n        cats = df[\"category\"].to_numpy()[mask]\n\n        result_series = pd.Series(values, index=cats).groupby(level=0).sum()\n        result = {str(k): int(v) for k, v in result_series.items()}\n    else:\n        result = {}\n\n    sorted_result = {k: result[k] for k in sorted(result.keys())}\n    print(\"TOTAL:\" + json.dumps(sorted_result))\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```",
